{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3371","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3371/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3371/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3371/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/3371","id":3306906556,"node_id":"I_kwDOAJbtsc7FG2O8","number":3371,"title":"v3: Fixture is created and initialized even if all tests using it are skipped","user":{"login":"johncrim","id":3312127,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIxMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3312127?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim","html_url":"https://github.com/johncrim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johncrim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":75574707,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NTU3NDcwNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"FEF2C0","default":false,"description":"A fault in an existing feature"},{"id":241290899,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDEyOTA4OTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Core%20framework","name":"Core framework","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"xunit.v3.core"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-08-09T22:10:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T17:53:18Z","closed_at":"2025-09-07T17:53:18Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In xUnit 2, when all tests are skipped (via `[Fact(Skip=\"Because...\")]` or similar) a fixture that is used only by the skipped tests is not created or `IAsyncLifetime.InitializeAsync()`ed.\n\nIn xUnit 3 using MTP mode, when all tests are statically skipped in the same way (so not using `SkipUnless` or `SkipWhen`), the fixture used only by skipped tests is always created and `IAsyncLifetime.InitializeAsync()`ed.\n\nI can collect more info and provide repro cases, but I thought I'd post the issue first in case it's by design. It's plausible that it's by design (certainly it makes sense that using `SkipUnless` or `SkipWhen` may always create+initialize the fixture).","closed_by":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admi